  "class_designation": "[{\"text\":\"When Ifirst came to Wah Yan, Iwas\",\"x\":0.12159330652980631,\"width\":0.3333333141940557,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"y\":0.8895348841403691},{\"text\":\"not accustomed\",\"x\":0.07756813771584402,\"width\":0.1383647757213517,\"height\":0.01025585180773414,\"y\":0.8749185667579393},{\"text\":\"to the lessons because\",\"x\":0.21593291594495811,\"width\":0.23689726491301888,\"height\":0.011726384364820874,\"y\":0.8749185668037095},{\"text\":\"most of them were conducted in English.\",\"x\":0.07756813862193768,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.013125899249645245,\"y\":0.8575581398998168},{\"text\":\"Gradually, I got used to them. And now I\",\"x\":0.07966457624422973,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.8400651467107049},{\"text\":\"think I can speak and write English fairly\",\"x\":0.07756813383057237,\"width\":0.3731656150781985,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.8241042344588214},{\"text\":\"correctly.\",\"x\":0.07534099275491289,\"width\":0.08411885474161056,\"height\":0.015274095069313764,\"y\":0.80631644084484},{\"text\":\"I\",\"x\":0.5408805035145462,\"width\":0.010482179815771375,\"height\":0.01017441827233534,\"y\":0.89244186068578},{\"text\":\"passed thefinal\",\"x\":0.5639413067943099,\"width\":0.15932913176427999,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"y\":0.8895348841888187},{\"text\":\"examination in\",\"x\":0.725366873453325,\"width\":0.1488469609200449,\"height\":0.011627906774465013,\"y\":0.892441860420907},{\"text\":\"Form 1 and Form 2 and I hope that Ican\",\"x\":0.49895178642067994,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.013123058729140658,\"y\":0.8764534887733633},{\"text\":\"be promoted to Form 3 this year. At\",\"x\":0.4989517812320007,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.8618892508948787},{\"text\":\"school, I am fond of science subjects, es-\",\"x\":0.4989517785590448,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.01468733436509917,\"y\":0.8472312701332746},{\"text\":\"pecially Biology. I am food of football\",\"x\":0.49475892459616405,\"width\":0.379454906101173,\"height\":0.016011097066177316,\"y\":0.8328488376258847},{\"text\":\"and basketball and I represent my class in\",\"x\":0.4989517854825248,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"height\":0.013129686610318214,\"y\":0.8211726386969872},{\"text\":\"interclass football and basketball matches.\",\"x\":0.49685535996828145,\"width\":0.37945490610117294,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"y\":0.8081395352450202},{\"text\":\"Nelson Wong Wai Hong （3B1）\",\"x\":0.6121593278531461,\"width\":0.26415094068783807,\"height\":0.011627906774464902,\"y\":0.7819767442290466},{\"text\":\"It is better to be a well ied slave rather than a starving iree man\",\"x\":0.1696894944468679,\"width\":0.6123940296478129,\"height\":0.018709022447418233,\"y\":0.6827231095480539},{\"text\":\"“I am free to do what I will; yes, but\",\"x\":0.12159330324115791,\"width\":0.335429754104686,\"height\":0.014662714656867193,\"y\":0.6351744186484285},{\"text\":\"I must not abdicate my own liberty.\\\" How\",\"x\":0.07966457468063791,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.6205211724147004},{\"text\":\"much sorrow would St. Paul have suffered\",\"x\":0.07966457058385255,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"height\":0.01311358970617238,\"y\":0.6061046512915318},{\"text\":\"if his liberty had been taken away com-\",\"x\":0.0796645737424828,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"y\":0.59011627909901},{\"text\":\"pletely? This statement suited St. Paul, and\",\"x\":0.0796645731170461,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"height\":0.013092757979899394,\"y\":0.5755700324557975},{\"text\":\"other saints of the ancient world.\",\"x\":0.07966458535580213,\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"height\":0.013355048859934882,\"y\":0.5609120520939027},{\"text\":\"How\",\"x\":0.4109014677787281,\"width\":0.044025155585101505,\"height\":0.011762366155071424,\"y\":0.560912052312103},{\"text\":\"many saints are there on this earth today？\",\"x\":0.07958309079501145,\"width\":0.375441370880615,\"height\":0.014993543966585254,\"y\":0.5449626455802513},{\"text\":\"I wonder.\",\"x\":0.07945079330989069,\"width\":0.08863295145115535,\"height\":0.011625716119325058,\"y\":0.5327025924326861},{\"text\":\"Today， ‘money'is powerful. Money，\",\"x\":0.12368973981072888,\"width\":0.3333333141940557,\"height\":0.01468544068476274,\"y\":0.5013029314613824},{\"text\":\"in many eyes, is the ‘God'of all might.\",\"x\":0.0796645737424828,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"y\":0.4869186046513355},{\"text\":\"With the increasing number of luxurious\",\"x\":0.0796645638186144,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013152412638213873,\"y\":0.4723127034576089},{\"text\":\"things, most people are turning their\",\"x\":0.07966457612904754,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.45635179162698014},{\"text\":\"mind more and more to material com-\",\"x\":0.07966457612904754,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.011734906547620993,\"y\":0.4433139534926124},{\"text\":\"forts. Every now and then, they ask for\",\"x\":0.07966458598229667,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.014674077360171789,\"y\":0.42573289917066326},{\"text\":\"money to buy more things for their own\",\"x\":0.08155638844702857,\"width\":0.37359797135906636,\"height\":0.019767959420766368,\"y\":0.40829574638916954},{\"text\":\"use. They even abdicate' their own liberty\",\"x\":0.07966456373549499,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.39674267079728465},{\"text\":\"to please their superior to get more\",\"x\":0.07966458060144431,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"y\":0.38226744207381613},{\"text\":\"money.\",\"x\":0.08176100867399784,\"width\":0.06498951521664438,\"height\":0.01017441827233534,\"y\":0.36773255837836727},{\"text\":\"What does this mean, They are\",\"x\":0.16142557276692654,\"width\":0.29559748192945967,\"height\":0.013355048859934882,\"y\":0.36612377836181575},{\"text\":\"just like well-fed slaves！\",\"x\":0.07966458142958616,\"width\":0.2410901303798213,\"height\":0.011731118565661891,\"y\":0.35309446283755885},{\"text\":\"They attach\",\"x\":0.3207547208088252,\"width\":0.1362683358107214,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"y\":0.3517441861752527},{\"text\":\"themselves too much to material comforts；\",\"x\":0.07966457612904754,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.01315714683905489,\"y\":0.33713355046437454},{\"text\":\"they forget their real lives.\",\"x\":0.077568135872088,\"width\":0.25157232993297274,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.3211726382486513},{\"text\":\"God created men. He wants them to\",\"x\":0.12368974036628443,\"width\":0.3333333141940557,\"height\":0.01178225104117625,\"y\":0.2950581396941627},{\"text\":\"live with their own free will.He warned\",\"x\":0.0796645727808783,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013112642244717976,\"y\":0.2790697678794679},{\"text\":\"people not to love material things.\",\"x\":0.08176102218823965,\"width\":0.3165618236179298,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"y\":0.26308139531994024},{\"text\":\"And\",\"x\":0.4192872114789748,\"width\":0.037735850207668786,\"height\":0.011726384364820874,\"y\":0.2644951141225348},{\"text\":\"people are so stubborn that they ignore\",\"x\":0.08176100937665472,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.248534202237223},{\"text\":\"this free gift. They can even sin in order\",\"x\":0.08176100917574623,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"height\":0.014670289999499042,\"y\":0.23387622172997935},{\"text\":\"to get more money. They say， “Money is\",\"x\":0.0796645862575894,\"width\":0.37945490610117294,\"height\":0.01609631827289193,\"y\":0.21791530968382977},{\"text\":\"far better than liberty! What is the mean-\",\"x\":0.08176100608350317,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.013124005569308816,\"y\":0.2034883722217644},{\"text\":\"ing of life if there are no comforts？”\",\"x\":0.07958431078051037,\"width\":0.3461341319617974,\"height\":0.01505599503408428,\"y\":0.18879850150959643},{\"text\":\"Life, will be meaningless if there is.\",\"x\":0.12578617642498466,\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"height\":0.013180819085832574,\"y\":0.16123778529124022},{\"text\":\"no liberty! Without liberty, he cannot ex-\",\"x\":0.08155503544059561,\"width\":0.37563765374198904,\"height\":0.018914861399498273,\"y\":0.1423528139316702},{\"text\":\"press his thoughts and glorious wishes; he is\",\"x\":0.08176102476636365,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"y\":0.1308139535079248},{\"text\":\"fooled by a dead body — money. He is a\",\"x\":0.5010482216408056,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014662714656867193,\"y\":0.6351744187574402},{\"text\":\"slave of it！\",\"x\":0.498904515993329,\"width\":0.10281990029737847,\"height\":0.013441353589781713,\"y\":0.6204595561491375},{\"text\":\"Money cannot buy liberty; but, nowa-\",\"x\":0.5450733839669134,\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.591530944662608},{\"text\":\"days, many people devote themselves too\",\"x\":0.501048221541225,\"width\":0.3752620549888287,\"height\":0.01335504885993477,\"y\":0.5768729639097396},{\"text\":\"much to ‘material freedom' that they ignore\",\"x\":0.4989517829485932,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.016122831661460557,\"y\":0.560912051903304},{\"text\":\"‘mental freedom’. They do not understand\",\"x\":0.5010482161463963,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.547882736427497},{\"text\":\"the meaning of liberty. Just give you a\",\"x\":0.501048221541225,\"width\":0.3752620549888287,\"height\":0.013136315112781793,\"y\":0.5319218241480119},{\"text\":\"holiday, and give you a yacht, you can sail.\",\"x\":0.5010482205796204,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013177031725159605,\"y\":0.5174418608300493},{\"text\":\"There are blue sky and blue sea in front.\",\"x\":0.5010482240429718,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"y\":0.5029069770667256},{\"text\":\"You have a feeling that your heart is en-\",\"x\":0.5010482347593755,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"y\":0.48691860486451377},{\"text\":\"lightened. There is a wide open space for\",\"x\":0.5010482356678312,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.4723127037819643},{\"text\":\"you to shout around. You can go any-\",\"x\":0.5010482242073145,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"y\":0.4563517914331817},{\"text\":\"where you like. That is what liberty is.\",\"x\":0.5010482365064056,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"y\":0.44186046508738197},{\"text\":\"You can exercise your own thoughts, can do\",\"x\":0.501048214035984,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"y\":0.42732558169850854},{\"text\":\"what you ‘really' like, but not against your\",\"x\":0.5010482148563501,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.016024354071104585,\"y\":0.41133720967893705},{\"text\":\"own heart and not against the law. You are\",\"x\":0.5010482196362244,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013144837295581913,\"y\":0.39825581437292723},{\"text\":\"not restricted at anytime, anyhow, and any-\",\"x\":0.5010482196362244,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"y\":0.3822674418897076},{\"text\":\"where. You are the happiest creature in the\",\"x\":0.5010482205796204,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.014677865342130891,\"y\":0.3677325581833123},{\"text\":\"world！\",\"x\":0.4989517839220762,\"width\":0.06498951521664431,\"height\":0.011627906774465013,\"y\":0.3546511629499768},{\"text\":\"But what will be a man's future if he\",\"x\":0.5429769434927304,\"width\":0.335429754104686,\"height\":0.013105067523372371,\"y\":0.32410423438277025},{\"text\":\"has to endure hunger in order to carry out\",\"x\":0.5010482159674613,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013355048859934882,\"y\":0.30944625422073024},{\"text\":\"his wishes? He will, frst, be exhausted; and\",\"x\":0.49895177959429565,\"width\":0.3773584948994591,\"height\":0.016286644951140072,\"y\":0.290553746031903},{\"text\":\"then he will feel a bit sad, thinking\",\"x\":0.5010482184828646,\"width\":0.3312369029923419,\"height\":0.01311264286600411,\"y\":0.2790697678322295},{\"text\":\"that\",\"x\":0.8343344515141313,\"width\":0.044119356717013614,\"height\":0.010371127423711934,\"y\":0.2818783899456173},{\"text\":\"everything and everybody in this world is\",\"x\":0.49874030068873093,\"width\":0.3798413281158131,\"height\":0.018911068447249657,\"y\":0.2612565277444556},{\"text\":\"unkind to him. His future will be much\",\"x\":0.5009583098408019,\"width\":0.3775430358140287,\"height\":0.01517166174972484,\"y\":0.24796345396202224},{\"text\":\"restricted！\",\"x\":0.4989110297955459,\"width\":0.09442112833850247,\"height\":0.013365570963011497,\"y\":0.23386954017459405},{\"text\":\"Is it better to be a starving free man\",\"x\":0.5450733861157604,\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"y\":0.20639534898999823},{\"text\":\"than a well fed slave? I have no idea. It\",\"x\":0.5010482353184252,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.013085182637267545,\"y\":0.191856677263061},{\"text\":\"is up to one's ownself to decide.\",\"x\":0.5010482180422934,\"width\":0.2851153110852246,\"height\":0.014661767816698923,\"y\":0.17719869729213988},{\"text\":\"Henry Yeung\",\"x\":0.7274358294111477,\"width\":0.11326251025482492,\"height\":0.013310944995196805,\"y\":0.14814103907867304},{\"text\":\"Form 5A\",\"x\":0.7441758177515703,\"width\":0.079782537996825,\"height\":0.010626031832120297,\"y\":0.1349486120390393},{\"text\":\"147\",\"x\":0.8427672947081168,\"width\":0.03563941388565306,\"height\":0.011737747068125581,\"y\":0.0638436481068978}]",
